        "line": 295,
        "text": "∃ ρ : ℝ, 0 < ρ ∧ ∀ p ∈ K, ∀ θ q₁ q₂ A' C', |q₁ - p₁ p| ≤ ρ → |q₂ - p₂ p| ≤ ρ → |A' - r.angularLoop (p,θ)| ≤ ρ → |C' - r.signedAxialLoop (p,θ)| ≤ ρ → InTrueCone q₁ q₂ A' C' — one uniform tolerance in the four cone coordinates"
